{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Lo4asBx9BZoBpu9gQALUqU","type":"tool_result","content":"== Definition of Done · T-20260915-policy-schema-versioned.md ==\n\nTraceability (every behavior → its verifying eval):\n  [x] B-1 → eval_1\n        GIVEN a policy mapping with a supported schema_version and in-range limit and window WHEN …\n  [x] B-2 → eval_2\n        GIVEN a policy whose limit is non-positive, non-integer, or above the maximum WHEN parse_policy …\n  [x] B-3 → eval_3\n        GIVEN a policy whose window_seconds is non-positive, non-integer, or above the maximum, or …\n\nDoD checklist (each acceptance criterion, terminal marked *):\n  [ ] * eval_1 — a well-formed versioned policy is accepted, normalized, and idempotent under re-parse ⟵ B-1\n  [ ] * eval_2 — invalid limits are rejected with field 'limit' and stable per-kind codes, while the valid policy is still accepted ⟵ B-2\n  [ ] * eval_3 — invalid windows and unsupported schema versions are rejected with stable deterministic codes, while the valid policy is … ⟵ B-3\n\nExit Check (runnable):\n  eval_1 && eval_2 && eval_3\n\nDOD=COMPLETE\nDOD_EXIT=0","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ef4871da-c626-455a-acbc-c3e47d420c0a","uuid":"9454d281-aa23-4bc0-8eee-d5d2d3bde849","timestamp":"2026-09-15T10:36:38.931Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"== Definition of Done · T-20260915-policy-schema-versioned.md ==\n\nTraceability (every behavior → its verifying eval):\n  [x] B-1 → eval_1\n        GIVEN a policy mapping with a supported schema_version and in-range limit and window WHEN …\n  [x] B-2 → eval_2\n        GIVEN a policy whose limit is non-positive, non-integer, or above the maximum WHEN parse_policy …\n  [x] B-3 → eval_3\n        GIVEN a policy whose window_seconds is non-positive, non-integer, or above the maximum, or …\n\nDoD checklist (each acceptance criterion, terminal marked *):\n  [ ] * eval_1 — a well-formed versioned policy is accepted, norma